13. Mandatory Communication Rule: Weights as Multipliers

Every post referencing the weight table must include a one-line caveat that weights multiply predicted probabilities, not raw engagement counts. This is X's own stated correction and is the most common misreading of the published data. The Adversarial Gate explicitly tests whether a post has made this clear.

